  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The masses of five balls at rest and lying at equal distances in a straight line are in geometrical progression with ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and their coefficients of restitution are each <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>. If the first ball be started towards the second with velocity <math><mi>u</mi></math>, then the velocity communicated to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>th</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;ball is</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
